WEBVTT

00:00:00.950 --> 00:00:03.590
Tobi, take care of the operation.

00:00:03.590 --> 00:00:05.720
I know. We have to hurry.

00:00:09.930 --> 00:00:11.990
Coordinates set. Beginning countdown.

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:19.250
Okay! Atori, everything is ready!

00:00:25.710 --> 00:00:29.810
All right... Now it's goodbye to La'cryma.

00:00:29.810 --> 00:00:31.780
This is the last time
we'll be seeing this place.

00:00:31.780 --> 00:00:33.780
Yeah, that's true.

00:00:42.020 --> 00:00:47.680
At the silver sky, the endless sky

00:00:48.020 --> 00:00:54.010
I gazed together with you, without a word

00:00:54.290 --> 00:01:00.190
Touching your back, with trembling fingers

00:01:00.380 --> 00:01:05.620
I quietly ponder, as your profile looks up

00:01:05.670 --> 00:01:11.660
I want to assure your smile, and the future ahead of you

00:01:11.660 --> 00:01:18.000
Just standing and crying, I want to erase myself away

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:23.880
As I extend my hands, it is almost within my reach

00:01:23.880 --> 00:01:29.930
This is no fantasy, possibilities are perhaps right by my side

00:01:29.930 --> 00:01:35.770
Changing every sorrow into strength

00:01:35.770 --> 00:01:41.940
Let's throw all limitations into the end of time

00:01:42.310 --> 00:01:45.130
Just keeping you as my aspirations

00:01:45.130 --> 00:01:50.280
Even in the driving wind

00:01:51.070 --> 00:01:57.220
I'll still be pushing on ahead

00:01:57.780 --> 00:02:02.880
Misekku kesta

00:02:03.940 --> 00:02:10.800
Fortune. Will you save it for me, dear?

00:02:18.490 --> 00:02:20.550
Baron, watch the house while I'm gone!

00:02:39.010 --> 00:02:40.540
Maybe I'm imagining things.

00:02:45.510 --> 00:02:46.610
Good afternoon!

00:02:46.610 --> 00:02:48.750
Aw, you're late!

00:02:48.750 --> 00:02:52.690
Haruka-chan, Ai-chan, what's wrong?
Come in, come in!

00:02:52.690 --> 00:02:55.400
Oba-san, your glasses...

00:02:55.400 --> 00:02:56.830
Aren't they great?

00:02:56.830 --> 00:02:59.330
These are the aura glasses
I bought by mail order the other day.

00:02:59.330 --> 00:03:02.530
Mama, I see a red aura around Ai!

00:03:02.530 --> 00:03:06.170
Really? I think I see a blue light.

00:03:06.170 --> 00:03:07.400
You're imagining that.

00:03:07.400 --> 00:03:10.210
We can see it if we concentrate!

00:03:10.210 --> 00:03:15.170
- Show us! Show us! Show us!
- This family is as weird as ever.

00:03:15.610 --> 00:03:17.380
Hey, Mama? Haruka says...

00:03:17.380 --> 00:03:20.580
there have been mysterious
happenings all around her.

00:03:20.580 --> 00:03:23.750
I want to find out the cause for her!

00:03:23.750 --> 00:03:25.600
Let me see...

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:28.460
Oh, I know! There's the prophecy board
I bought the other day.

00:03:28.460 --> 00:03:30.020
Oh, that!

00:03:31.260 --> 00:03:32.590
Maybe we should go?

00:03:32.590 --> 00:03:35.520
We can't. She's doing it
because she's worried.

00:03:36.230 --> 00:03:39.320
I want nothing to do with
the UFO-summoning ceremony.

00:04:13.970 --> 00:04:16.170
This is a Ouija board.

00:04:16.170 --> 00:04:19.870
It's the Western version
of a Kokkuri-san.

00:04:19.870 --> 00:04:20.740
Oh...

00:04:20.740 --> 00:04:22.530
Kokkuri-san, huh?

00:04:23.040 --> 00:04:25.210
Haruka, put your hand on this.

00:04:25.210 --> 00:04:26.280
Sure.

00:04:28.950 --> 00:04:31.650
Now concentrate very hard.

00:04:31.650 --> 00:04:37.300
You must wish ever so gently so you
won't startle the spirits of the dead.

00:04:37.300 --> 00:04:39.060
Spirits of the dead. Riiiight.

00:04:39.060 --> 00:04:43.510
Dear spirits! Haruka is distressed
about mysterious happenings!

00:04:43.510 --> 00:04:46.300
Please tell us the reason for them.

00:04:46.300 --> 00:04:47.500
Yeah, yeah...

00:04:47.500 --> 00:04:48.960
Just a minute, Ai!

00:04:49.570 --> 00:04:51.970
You have to chant with me!

00:04:51.970 --> 00:04:54.510
What?! I gotta do it too?!

00:04:54.510 --> 00:04:58.400
All together now.
Dear spirits, dear spirits!

00:04:58.400 --> 00:05:02.150
Haruka is distressed
about mysterious happenings!

00:05:02.420 --> 00:05:05.660
Please tell us the reason for them!

00:05:05.660 --> 00:05:08.660
Dear spirits, dear spirits...

00:05:11.060 --> 00:05:13.040
- It moved!
- Get outta here!

00:05:15.300 --> 00:05:16.720
N?

00:05:17.770 --> 00:05:19.230
O...

00:05:21.040 --> 00:05:22.530
E...

00:05:24.910 --> 00:05:26.440
I...

00:05:28.340 --> 00:05:29.940
And N again.

00:05:30.450 --> 00:05:32.550
Perhaps it's Noein.

00:05:32.550 --> 00:05:33.980
Mama, what does it mean?

00:05:33.980 --> 00:05:35.080
Beats me.

00:05:35.080 --> 00:05:36.920
It doesn't make sense.

00:05:36.920 --> 00:05:38.480
Yeah...

00:05:38.480 --> 00:05:41.090
Forget about asking about me.

00:05:41.090 --> 00:05:44.110
Since we've got it out, let's
ask something more interesting!

00:05:44.530 --> 00:05:47.620
More interesting? I know!

00:05:47.620 --> 00:05:50.730
Let's ask it when Miho
will get married.

00:05:50.730 --> 00:05:53.120
What? No way! Eek!

00:05:53.120 --> 00:05:56.240
Huh? You can't! It's embarrassing!

00:05:56.240 --> 00:05:58.240
Why not? It's fortune-telling.

00:05:58.240 --> 00:06:00.370
Marriage of all things...

00:06:00.810 --> 00:06:02.210
Miho, you've got a nosebleed.

00:06:02.210 --> 00:06:03.550
It's starting to drip!

00:06:08.180 --> 00:06:10.590
Have they confirmed the coordinates
of Atori and the others?

00:06:10.590 --> 00:06:12.620
Not yet, apparently.

00:06:13.020 --> 00:06:15.250
What are the observers doing?!

00:06:15.590 --> 00:06:17.100
Don't blame them.

00:06:17.830 --> 00:06:21.200
One investigator has been killed.
They're desperate.

00:06:21.200 --> 00:06:23.130
They are a disgrace to
the dragon knights.

00:06:23.130 --> 00:06:26.600
They're most likely
after the Dragon Torque.

00:06:26.600 --> 00:06:28.470
They should be at its coordinates.

00:06:28.470 --> 00:06:30.170
The Dragon Torque?

00:06:30.170 --> 00:06:31.630
This is bad.

00:06:32.470 --> 00:06:35.940
I'll take Karasu and go in
ahead to search for Atori.

00:06:37.050 --> 00:06:40.010
Dammit. Everything is in chaos.

00:06:42.220 --> 00:06:43.890
Thanks for having us over!

00:06:43.890 --> 00:06:45.190
See ya, Miho.

00:06:45.190 --> 00:06:47.130
Bye!

00:06:47.490 --> 00:06:48.990
They're nice girls.

00:06:48.990 --> 00:06:51.720
I choose my friends very carefully.

00:07:02.470 --> 00:07:04.520
Are you finding this nostalgic?

00:07:06.470 --> 00:07:09.670
That Haruka is not the Haruka we know.

00:07:10.780 --> 00:07:11.950
Yeah.

00:07:11.950 --> 00:07:15.790
She is the sacrifice so we may exist.

00:07:18.420 --> 00:07:20.390
Don't think about it.

00:07:20.390 --> 00:07:22.860
Every event that transpires
in this place...

00:07:22.860 --> 00:07:25.250
is the origin of it all.

00:07:26.960 --> 00:07:28.600
What happened?

00:07:28.600 --> 00:07:31.900
Atori and the others transported to
this dimension on their own.

00:07:31.900 --> 00:07:33.890
Their coordinates won't stabilize.

00:07:34.300 --> 00:07:35.970
Atori and the others?

00:07:36.670 --> 00:07:38.390
Be on your guard, Karasu.

00:07:38.390 --> 00:07:40.040
Understood.

00:07:46.510 --> 00:07:49.620
You're such a hard worker, Uchida-chan.
Would you like a beer?

00:07:50.150 --> 00:07:53.280
Don't you think you should
take a little breather?

00:07:54.790 --> 00:07:58.760
Kooriyama-san, you know
tomorrow's schedule...

00:07:58.760 --> 00:08:00.790
so please return to your own room.

00:08:01.560 --> 00:08:04.960
I need to have the data
organized by tomorrow.

00:08:05.530 --> 00:08:07.100
Sounds fun.

00:08:08.370 --> 00:08:12.800
Kooriyama-san, don't the holes in
the brick wall bother you?

00:08:14.780 --> 00:08:18.970
You're the big puzzle-solving
specialist with Ab-Com...

00:08:19.950 --> 00:08:21.680
...not me.

00:08:21.680 --> 00:08:25.770
Kooriyama-san, would you do me a favor
and not use that strange abbreviation?

00:08:26.420 --> 00:08:30.090
Its full name is the Absolute Critical
Prevention Strategic Committee.

00:08:30.090 --> 00:08:31.430
Gotcha.

00:08:31.430 --> 00:08:34.330
So, how are your abs?

00:08:34.330 --> 00:08:36.490
I'll sue you for sexual harassment.

00:08:51.930 --> 00:08:56.340
Look at the time. I better
start preparing for supper.

00:08:57.050 --> 00:08:59.650
What would you like to eat? Hamburger?

00:08:59.650 --> 00:09:01.820
Or how about cream stew?

00:09:01.820 --> 00:09:04.150
Mom, I...

00:09:04.660 --> 00:09:07.320
I know what's best for you!

00:09:09.760 --> 00:09:11.070
So please, Yuu...

00:09:11.270 --> 00:09:13.520
do as I ask.

00:09:13.840 --> 00:09:17.030
Please don't let your mother down.

00:09:17.540 --> 00:09:19.280
You're a good boy, aren't you?

00:09:21.440 --> 00:09:25.290
I believe in you. I know you can do it.

00:09:25.290 --> 00:09:28.480
I know you can succeed like my sister.

00:09:45.100 --> 00:09:46.790
What the hell?!

00:09:47.500 --> 00:09:50.240
Stop goofing off and keep practicing.

00:09:50.240 --> 00:09:53.470
Up yours. I was training
in my thoughts.

00:09:53.470 --> 00:09:54.970
Oh?

00:09:55.710 --> 00:09:58.740
I don't think I could stand
being in Yuu's shoes.

00:10:01.450 --> 00:10:03.330
Can't you get through on his cell phone?

00:10:03.920 --> 00:10:07.090
His mom confiscated it ages ago.

00:10:07.460 --> 00:10:08.590
Oh.

00:10:08.590 --> 00:10:11.630
Exams are stupid, you know?

00:10:11.630 --> 00:10:15.430
Going to a good school doesn't
necessarily mean a bright future.

00:10:15.430 --> 00:10:16.820
Right, Hasebe?

00:10:17.830 --> 00:10:19.290
There.

00:10:20.590 --> 00:10:24.230
That's just your excuse
for not wanting to study.

00:10:24.440 --> 00:10:27.280
Is not! I'm worried about Yuu!

00:10:27.280 --> 00:10:29.200
All right, all right.

00:10:33.610 --> 00:10:35.820
What's the big idea, Hasebe?!

00:10:36.280 --> 00:10:38.320
Pull it together, boys!

00:10:38.320 --> 00:10:40.540
Freaky chick alert.

00:10:41.330 --> 00:10:43.520
What are you mad at?

00:10:44.790 --> 00:10:46.250
Stupid.

00:10:51.030 --> 00:10:52.840
She's nuts.

00:11:09.820 --> 00:11:12.230
Yuu, what's wrong with you?

00:11:42.220 --> 00:11:44.090
No big deal, Tobi.

00:11:44.090 --> 00:11:47.580
We still don't know how the effects
of releasing the pipeline will manifest.

00:11:48.090 --> 00:11:49.780
I like it here.

00:11:50.690 --> 00:11:55.020
The sky is blue. I would
be happy to disappear here.

00:11:55.360 --> 00:11:56.960
Isuka...

00:11:57.670 --> 00:11:59.730
I won't disappear that easily.

00:12:00.770 --> 00:12:03.060
Not until I destroy the Dragon Torque.

00:12:08.640 --> 00:12:10.700
That lady is impossible!

00:12:10.700 --> 00:12:12.380
In what way?

00:12:12.380 --> 00:12:14.790
I went to Yuu's house
a second ago, y'know?

00:12:21.130 --> 00:12:23.590
Don't you think that's extreme?

00:12:23.590 --> 00:12:26.190
It can't be helped if he's taking exams.

00:12:26.190 --> 00:12:27.560
She's right.

00:12:27.560 --> 00:12:31.560
This will be our last
summer break together.

00:12:31.560 --> 00:12:33.810
'Cause if he qualifies,
he'll be going to Tokyo.

00:12:35.040 --> 00:12:37.240
He's going to Tokyo.

00:12:37.240 --> 00:12:41.070
Do you think Goto really wants
to go to middle school in Tokyo?

00:12:41.380 --> 00:12:43.870
I have to see him to make sure!

00:12:44.310 --> 00:12:47.620
Okay! I'll sneak into
Yuu's house tonight, and...

00:12:47.620 --> 00:12:49.580
For late-night nookie!

00:12:49.580 --> 00:12:51.020
Get it straight!

00:12:51.020 --> 00:12:53.320
That hurt, Ai...

00:12:53.320 --> 00:12:54.820
It's your own fault!

00:12:55.160 --> 00:12:56.840
Young lady...

00:12:58.760 --> 00:13:02.860
Be careful. You are creating a ripple.

00:13:02.860 --> 00:13:04.370
Is he talking to me?

00:13:04.370 --> 00:13:05.800
Haruka, what's wrong?

00:13:05.800 --> 00:13:07.870
Huh? That man is talking to me.

00:13:07.870 --> 00:13:10.060
Man? Where?

00:13:10.600 --> 00:13:13.310
What are you talking about, Ai?
He's standing right there.

00:13:14.780 --> 00:13:16.210
I don't see anyone.

00:13:16.210 --> 00:13:17.670
What's the matter?

00:13:20.720 --> 00:13:22.750
No one else can see him.

00:13:26.220 --> 00:13:27.870
Coordinates fixed.

00:13:28.790 --> 00:13:33.080
Five, four, three, two...

00:13:33.080 --> 00:13:35.210
It will be thrown off!
Time will be thrown off!

00:13:35.210 --> 00:13:38.120
It will be thrown off!

00:13:42.640 --> 00:13:44.130
Got her!

00:13:44.760 --> 00:13:46.010
Ai, help me!

00:13:51.410 --> 00:13:54.640
Haruka?! You've disturbed the
dimension, Atori!

00:14:00.420 --> 00:14:03.320
Haruka... Haruka disappeared.

00:14:08.900 --> 00:14:11.160
This is the strongest reading ever.

00:14:13.070 --> 00:14:14.370
Keep going straight.

00:14:16.370 --> 00:14:18.380
I told you to go straight!

00:14:18.380 --> 00:14:20.770
Lay off. The road is crooked.

00:14:27.970 --> 00:14:29.650
Ow.

00:14:31.020 --> 00:14:32.470
Huh?

00:14:38.190 --> 00:14:39.980
How'd I get here?

00:14:49.670 --> 00:14:51.240
It's an illusion.

00:14:51.240 --> 00:14:54.250
It's all an illusion, Dragon Torque.

00:14:56.200 --> 00:14:59.960
Tobi, release the Reizu
on the Dragon Torque.

00:15:03.920 --> 00:15:05.880
Huh? What's wrong, Tobi?

00:15:06.190 --> 00:15:07.880
He must have used too much power.

00:15:07.880 --> 00:15:10.860
Damn... whatever.

00:15:10.860 --> 00:15:13.080
Isuka, you do it!

00:15:15.860 --> 00:15:18.730
So you're absolutely sure that
if we destroy the Dragon Torque...

00:15:18.730 --> 00:15:20.300
Just do it.

00:15:22.870 --> 00:15:24.300
Karasu!

00:15:25.040 --> 00:15:27.440
What do you intend to do
with the Dragon Torque?

00:15:28.180 --> 00:15:30.380
You again?

00:15:30.380 --> 00:15:32.830
Karasu, it's dangerous!

00:15:33.080 --> 00:15:35.420
If we return to La'cryma
with the Dragon Torque...

00:15:35.420 --> 00:15:37.580
we'll run the risk of
blowing away our dimension!

00:15:37.580 --> 00:15:41.080
Risk? Did you say risk?!

00:15:42.420 --> 00:15:43.990
Don't make me laugh!

00:15:43.990 --> 00:15:47.290
It's a little late for us citizens
of La'cryma to worry about risks...

00:15:47.290 --> 00:15:50.430
We're already living a quantum existence,
all order destroyed.

00:15:50.730 --> 00:15:54.730
If the Dragon Torque really will
obliterate all the dimensions...

00:15:55.850 --> 00:15:57.560
Then let them be obliterated!

00:15:59.510 --> 00:16:02.540
What now, Isuka? He wants a fight.

00:16:04.180 --> 00:16:06.070
Then we have no other choice.

00:16:07.750 --> 00:16:09.680
Let's take him in one fell swoop.

00:16:13.620 --> 00:16:15.330
Disappear!

00:16:47.290 --> 00:16:50.320
That damn Atori
is at it again!

00:17:03.570 --> 00:17:05.430
Impressive, Karasu!

00:17:14.970 --> 00:17:16.650
Let go!

00:17:17.990 --> 00:17:19.020
Don't!

00:17:19.020 --> 00:17:21.850
Isuka, destroy the Dragon Torque quickly.

00:17:22.890 --> 00:17:24.760
Let go!

00:17:24.760 --> 00:17:26.230
Give it up, Karasu!

00:17:26.230 --> 00:17:27.360
Don't!

00:17:27.360 --> 00:17:29.740
Kill her already, Isuka!

00:17:36.740 --> 00:17:38.200
Yuu...

00:17:38.510 --> 00:17:40.170
Haruka?

00:17:46.250 --> 00:17:48.250
Haruka will eventually disappear...

00:17:48.250 --> 00:17:50.300
...from your sight.

00:17:53.890 --> 00:17:56.920
Don't... Stop it, Isuka.

00:17:57.790 --> 00:17:59.220
Help me...

00:17:59.860 --> 00:18:00.970
Stop!

00:18:45.540 --> 00:18:47.230
Sure is peaceful.

00:18:47.570 --> 00:18:51.070
Hey, the readings are rising again.
From in there!

00:18:51.550 --> 00:18:53.010
Coming.

00:18:54.400 --> 00:18:57.950
Damn. Karasu triggered a highside.

00:18:58.950 --> 00:19:00.680
I can't handle that.

00:19:01.460 --> 00:19:04.540
Whoops, I'd forgotten about him.

00:19:07.460 --> 00:19:09.060
Karasu...

00:19:09.060 --> 00:19:11.630
this is farewell.

00:19:11.630 --> 00:19:13.960
Now I'll be out of my misery.

00:19:20.710 --> 00:19:22.900
Blue snow?

00:19:24.350 --> 00:19:25.560
Karasu...

00:19:27.150 --> 00:19:29.340
Goodbye, Karasu.

00:19:39.530 --> 00:19:42.260
Disappear! It should all vanish to hell!

00:19:42.260 --> 00:19:43.540
Stop it!

00:19:43.800 --> 00:19:45.790
Don't destroy my town!

00:19:46.030 --> 00:19:48.500
It would make...
It would make everyone sad!

00:19:49.370 --> 00:19:50.750
Please stop!

00:20:01.750 --> 00:20:04.710
Haruka, think of the future...

00:20:05.320 --> 00:20:10.290
...the future you wish for.
You have the power to do so.

00:20:11.190 --> 00:20:12.860
Believe in it.

00:20:13.330 --> 00:20:14.940
And think.

00:20:15.330 --> 00:20:17.150
What is this?!

00:20:31.980 --> 00:20:34.550
Did she swap it
for a different dimension?

00:20:34.550 --> 00:20:38.180
Does this Haruka have the power
to manipulate dimensions?

00:20:42.260 --> 00:20:44.850
Huh? I feel so weak.

00:20:46.930 --> 00:20:50.430
What's happening to me?

00:21:00.940 --> 00:21:02.740
Are you alright, Karasu?!

00:21:02.740 --> 00:21:04.040
Yeah.

00:21:04.040 --> 00:21:06.510
That's... the Dragon Torque.

00:21:06.850 --> 00:21:09.080
- You secured it?
- No.

00:21:10.580 --> 00:21:14.630
What is this unusual power?
Where's Atori and the others?

00:21:15.560 --> 00:21:17.630
I killed Isuka.

00:21:18.340 --> 00:21:20.030
What happened here?!

00:21:20.030 --> 00:21:21.830
I cannot surrender the Dragon Torque.

00:21:21.830 --> 00:21:22.930
Karasu!

00:21:22.930 --> 00:21:24.620
I will not surrender Haruka.

00:21:27.070 --> 00:21:28.670
This is bad.

00:21:29.640 --> 00:21:32.770
Damn Karasu!
I must bring him back quickly.

00:21:37.710 --> 00:21:39.780
Did you see that?

00:21:40.250 --> 00:21:41.940
I think I saw it.

00:21:44.120 --> 00:21:46.050
But would anyone believe it?

00:21:46.050 --> 00:21:47.820
Good point.

00:21:47.820 --> 00:21:49.780
Hey, did you get a shot of it?

00:21:51.090 --> 00:21:52.790
Let me see it.

00:21:59.730 --> 00:22:01.420
What the?

00:22:03.770 --> 00:22:06.530
Yuu, what's wrong? I'm coming in.

00:22:26.360 --> 00:22:28.500
Why won't she pick up?

00:22:34.970 --> 00:22:37.130
No matter what,
you must protect this girl.

00:22:37.130 --> 00:22:39.630
Wh... What are you talking about?!

00:22:39.840 --> 00:22:41.940
I will perform
a forced transposition on Karasu.

